        "note": "nrGrowthIndex, 50,955 rows, copied whole: the growth indicator series, truncated toward zero on read. int64 here where the execution copy held decimal text, and `float_columns` is still needed: growth pattern 1169 is NULL in all 43 of its years, and a null in an integer column refuses to ingest. It arrives as a NaN, exactly as the execution copy's empty decimal text did.",
